    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My grandpa turned into a zombie. At least he stopped asking when I\u2019m having kids&quot;</strong> is a project consisting of two main parts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-style action shooter inspired by <i>Zombies Ate My Neighbors.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor that allows players to build their own levels and campaigns, and share them with others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels included with the game are built using the internal editor, which means players have the same tools for creating content as the developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features of the action shooter:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between melee, ranged, or hybrid characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D graphics that keep the feel of retro games while adding the flexibility of a third dimension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features of the level editor:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same tools as the developers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud upload, rating system, and leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to create multi-level campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-layered design: underground tunnels, basements, second floors, rooftops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible customization of weapon stats, enemy types, hero parameters, and enemy strength and count.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My grandpa turned into a zombie. At least he stopped asking when I\u2019m having kids&quot;</strong> is a project consisting of two main parts:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-style action shooter inspired by <i>Zombies Ate My Neighbors.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor that allows players to build their own levels and campaigns, and share them with others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels included with the game are built using the internal editor, which means players have the same tools for creating content as the developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features of the action shooter:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between melee, ranged, or hybrid characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D graphics that keep the feel of retro games while adding the flexibility of a third dimension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features of the level editor:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same tools as the developers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud upload, rating system, and leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to create multi-level campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-layered design: underground tunnels, basements, second floors, rooftops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible customization of weapon stats, enemy types, hero parameters, and enemy strength and count.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Survive a campaign filled with horror and despair, handcrafted by developers. Then open the level editor and discover the true terror: what other players are capable of imagining.",
